<section class="c-container u-transparent-bg c-container--inset "
    id="school-visits">

    
    <section class="c-container__blocks">

        <div class="o-layout o-layout--center">
                            <div class="o-layout__item">
    <section class="an-element c-container u-transparent-bg c-container--1400 "
        id="schools">

        
        <section class="c-container__blocks">
            <div class="o-layout o-layout--center">
                            <div class="o-layout__item u-1/1@desktop">
    <div data-os-animation="fadeInUp" class="c-col c-col-card c-col--has-bg-color u-parchment-white-bg c-animate-in c-col-card--inline c-col-card--has-link">

        <div class="c-col-card__main">

                            <figure class="c-col-card__fig">
                    <img
                        src="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2022/02/Visit-Risk-Assessment-and-COVID-19-Advice-for-Schools.png?resize=16%2C10&gravity"
                        data-sizes="auto"
                        data-srcset="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2022/02/Visit-Risk-Assessment-and-COVID-19-Advice-for-Schools.png?resize=16%2C10&gravity 16w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2022/02/Visit-Risk-Assessment-and-COVID-19-Advice-for-Schools.png?resize=480%2C300&gravity 480w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2022/02/Visit-Risk-Assessment-and-COVID-19-Advice-for-Schools.png?resize=640%2C400&gravity 640w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2022/02/Visit-Risk-Assessment-and-COVID-19-Advice-for-Schools.png?resize=960%2C600&gravity 960w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2022/02/Visit-Risk-Assessment-and-COVID-19-Advice-for-Schools.png?resize=1600%2C1000&gravity 1600w"
                        class="lazyload"
                        alt="A school group walking into the yard of the Globe Theatre"
                        title="School visits"
                    />
                </figure>
            
            <div class="c-col-card__content">
                                    <h4 class="c-col-title c-col-card__title"><p>Planning a school visit?</p>
</h4>
                                                <div class="c-col-text-area">

                    <p>2026 is the perfect year to bring your class to Shakespeare&#8217;s Globe.</p>
<p>Combine a <strong>performance</strong> with a <strong>practical and inspiring workshop</strong> tailored to the production, either in your school before or after your visit or in one of our rehearsal rooms on the day of the show.</p>
<p>School tickets are limited and must be requested via our online booking form. We&#8217;re expecting high demand so get your request in early for the best chance to secure tickets.</p>
<p><a class="c-btn c-btn--ghost" href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/learn/schools-and-teachers/secondary-schools/summer-2026-school-visits/">DISCOVER MORE <i class="fa-light fa-arrow-right"></i></a>  <a class="c-btn c-btn--ghost" href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/school-booking-form-2026/">ENQUIRE NOW <i class="fa-light fa-arrow-right"></i></a></p>

                                    </div>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="o-layout__item u-1/1@desktop">
    <div class="c-col c-col-text-area u-transparent-bg" >
    	
        
            </div>
</div>
                        </div>
        </section>

        
    </section>
</div>
                    </div>

    </section>

    
</section>
