                            data-dialog-title='Colm Gormley'
                            data-dialog-content='&lt;p&gt;Previous work for Shakespeare’s Globe includes &lt;em&gt;Romeo and Juliet&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Much Ado About Nothing, The Winter’s Tale, The Taming of the Shrew, As You Like It, A Midsummer Night’s Dream, The Tempest, The Merchant of Venice, &lt;/em&gt;and &lt;em&gt;Twelfth Night.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
