                                                    </div>
                    				                                            <div class="o-layout__item c-col-bio-single">
                            <h3 class="c-col-bio__role u-h3">Percussion</h3>
                                                            <a href="#0"
                                data-a11y-dialog-show="a11y-dialog"
                                data-dialog-title='Louise Anna Duggan'
                                data-dialog-content='<p>Previous work at Shakespeare’s Globe includes: <em>Macbeth, Playing Shakespeare </em>(Composer), <em>Twelfth Night, Princess Essex All’s Well that Ends Well, Macbeth, As You Like It, (2019) Boudica, The Taming of the Shrew, The Inn at Lydda </em>(Musical Director);  <em>As You Like It</em> (2019 &amp; 2026), <em>Hamlet </em>(Percussionist).</p>
<br>
                                                                    <a href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/bio/louise-anna-duggan/">View full biography</a>
                                '

                                                                    data-dialog-img='<figure class="c-col-bio__mugshot">
                                        <img
                                            src="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2022/01/Louise-Anna-Duggan.jpg?resize=320%2C320&gravity"
