                                data-dialog-title='Marley-Rose Liburd'
                                data-dialog-content='<p>Marley-Rose Liburd, is a Grenadian bred, Brooklyn raised, and London based Creative Producer and Theatre-maker. Previous work at Shakespeare’s Globe includes <em>Deep Azure</em>.</p>
<br>
                                                                    <a href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/bio/marley-rose-liburd/">View full biography</a>
                                '

                                                                    data-dialog-img='<figure class="c-col-bio__mugshot">
